"You can drink your fancy ales, you can drink them by the flagon;

but the only brew for the brave and true

comes from the Green Dragon!"

"7 am Breakfast"
"paired with meats, jams, and coffee or tea"

- Hobbit hash
- Ham omelet made with curry spices, onions, and tomatoes
- Honey nut cake and marmalade

"9 am Second Breakfast"
"paired with pastries, fruits and coffee or tea"

-Strawberry French toast with a side of sausage
-Breakfast pie made with salmon, leeks, eggs, and cream
-Scones and clotted cream

"11 am Elevenses"
"paired with types of tea or coffee"

-Lavender and lemon muffins
-Lemon tea cake
-Caraway seed cake

"1 pm Luncheon"
"paired with a slice of heavy, multigrain bread and a glass of wine or ale"

-Shepherd’s pie
-Roast mutton
-Fish and chips

"3 pm Afternoon Tea"
"paired with types of tea or coffee"

-Berry pie
-Mixed berry cobbler
-Apple pie and cream

"6 pm Dinner"
"Paired with assortments of bread, cheese, and malty dark beer"

-Spiced beef and roasted vegetables
-Savory porridge
